  {
    "id": 6023003080020,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "『G.R.A.D.』優勝は……\r\n『市川雛菜』だって～～～♡",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602300308/6023003080020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろん見てたよ！\r\nおめでとう、雛菜！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "こっちまで楽しくて、幸せになれる\r\nそんなステージだったぞ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6023003080030,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あは～\r\nほんとに～？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602300308/6023003080030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……勝っても負けてもいいって言ったのは\r\n嘘じゃないけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、雛菜の凄さが証明できたみたいで\r\n……優勝できたことも、嬉しいよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6023003080040,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ん～\r\nそうだよね～…………",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602300308/6023003080040"
  },
  {
    "id": 6023003080050,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "雛菜が楽しくしあわせ～にステージに立ってるだけで\r\nいいよって言ってくれる人もいると思うけど",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602300308/6023003080050"
  },
  {
    "id": 6023003080060,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "いっぱい応援したらその分、\r\n負けちゃった時に残念に思う人も、いるでしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602300308/6023003080060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、確かに\r\n……そうかもしれないな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6023003080070,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "もしかしたら雛菜よりずっと、雛菜のことが\r\nしあわせの全部になっちゃってる人もいるのかもしれないし",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602300308/6023003080070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6023003080080,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "だから、ちゃんと\r\n何が雛菜にとってしあわせなのか",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602300308/6023003080080"
  },
  {
    "id": 6023003080090,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "みんなに、伝えないとね",
